; CKP_4X_input_capture_isr_81E3
;   IC4 4X crank (CKP) input-capture ISR, far-called from bank-0 7E67: sets PUMP_BACKUPFLAGS.6, clears IC4F, reads
;        TCNT and computes the interrupt latency IC4_LATENCY = TCNT - TIC4.
;   analysis [medium]: Mid-instruction banner: the real entry is b1:81E3 (far call from bank0 7E67), the IC4 (4X
;        crank CKP) interrupt handler. It sets PUMP_BACKUPFLAGS.6, clears IC4F, records IC4_LATENCY, checks the
;        TIO ref period ($14A4) against the cal windows, counts CKP edges for the cam/CKP match tests (P0251,
;        P0335), checks the high-res encoder count for P0370, sets cranking fuel, schedules the backup reference
;        on
;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes TFLG1
