;        CAL_EGR_VENT_PRESS (FLAGS2.6). After CAL_EGR_BARO_DELAY ticks vented it copies the AN7 sensor into
;        BARO_VOLTAGE and sets $C7.2. Otherwise it sets b3 and clears the timer. Scan-tool override via 1CC5/1CC6
;        b1.
